{"title":"Welcome","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Welcome","about":{"template":"jolla"}},"headingText":"What is this Website For?","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left !important;\" markdown=\"1\">\n\n\nThis website exists to share my ongoing mathematics and statistics research and essays, as well as to offer quality academic and professional services.\n\n## Services\n\n* **Mathematics & Statistics Tutoring and Resource Generation**\n* **Mathematics & Statistics Consulting**\n\nIf you are interested in any of these services, please get in touch.\n\n## Research & Essays\n\nMy research interests include:\n\n* Power-law and heavy-tailed distributions\n* Statistics and mathematical modelling applied to macroeconomics, population, and energy/resources\n\n## Resources\n\nI share free resources for students, tutors, teachers, or anyone interested in learning mathematics. **Requests for tailored worksheets are welcome.**\n\n## AI Disclosure\n\nAI is imperfect, but it is a useful tool that I use to accelerate and refine my work. Currently, I primarily use Google Gemini.\n\n## Support & Contact\n\nIf you would like to support the ongoing development of this website, you can [leave a contribution via Stripe](https://buy.stripe.com/4gM3cv3Pz4co7fS8VC53O00){target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0066cc;\"}.\n\nEmail: **forbessam2 [at] gmail [dot] com**\n\n</div>","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left !important;\" markdown=\"1\">\n\n## What is this Website For?\n\nThis website exists to share my ongoing mathematics and statistics research and essays, as well as to offer quality academic and professional services.\n\n## Services\n\n* **Mathematics & Statistics Tutoring and Resource Generation**\n* **Mathematics & Statistics Consulting**\n\nIf you are interested in any of these services, please get in touch.\n\n## Research & Essays\n\nMy research interests include:\n\n* Power-law and heavy-tailed distributions\n* Statistics and mathematical modelling applied to macroeconomics, population, and energy/resources\n\n## Resources\n\nI share free resources for students, tutors, teachers, or anyone interested in learning mathematics. **Requests for tailored worksheets are welcome.**\n\n## AI Disclosure\n\nAI is imperfect, but it is a useful tool that I use to accelerate and refine my work. Currently, I primarily use Google Gemini.\n\n## Support & Contact\n\nIf you would like to support the ongoing development of this website, you can [leave a contribution via Stripe](https://buy.stripe.com/4gM3cv3Pz4co7fS8VC53O00){target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0066cc;\"}.\n\nEmail: **forbessam2 [at] gmail [dot] com**\n\n</div>"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","def